
# NavigateToGoal.action
# ROS2 action interface for strategy_node (Layer 1 - global planning). One
# goal = the whole mission: an ordered list of goal waypoints (legs) the
# agent must visit in sequence. Each waypoint is checked for reachability
# (via the currently configured global planner - see the `planner` ROS
# param and hybraut_nav_strategy.path_planning.PlannerType) from wherever
# the previous leg ends, before any of them are ever dispatched - no
# intermediate waypoints are synthesized between caller-supplied
# waypoints; a leg that can't be reached is reported, not patched around.
# strategy_node dispatches the list to tactical_node's own execute_mission
# action (see hybraut_nav/action/ExecuteMission.action) one leg at a time,
# in order, until it is exhausted. If the agent drifts off the leg it is
# currently executing, only that one leg's reachability is re-checked from
# the agent's current position before resuming the same target - the
# caller-supplied goal_waypoints list itself is never altered. Feedback
# carries both the live state of whichever leg is currently executing
# (relayed from tactical_node's own feedback) and mission-level progress
# across the whole list.

# Goal
builtin_interfaces/Time stamp
string mission_tag
hybraut_nav/Waypoint[] goal_waypoints   # ordered list of goal waypoints (legs) to visit in sequence

---
# Result
bool success
string message
builtin_interfaces/Duration total_mission_duration   # wall-clock time from goal accepted to this result

---

# Feedback
# -- mission-level progress --
hybraut_nav/Waypoint[] planned_waypoints          # the caller-supplied goal_waypoints, echoed back as the active route (never mutated mid-mission)
uint32 current_waypoint_index                          # index into planned_waypoints of the leg now executing
float64 progress                                       # 0.0-1.0, distance-based fraction of the route completed
builtin_interfaces/Duration elapsed_time                # time since this mission's goal was accepted
builtin_interfaces/Duration estimated_time_remaining    # projected from distance-covered/elapsed-time so far;
                                                         # zero until at least one leg has completed (no speed
                                                         # estimate yet)
# -- relayed from the currently active tactical_node leg --
string tactical_automaton_state
builtin_interfaces/Duration tactical_time_since_last_transition
geometry_msgs/Point current_position
builtin_interfaces/Time stamp
